> """Guards for survivors of the mutation sample (lead order 219) and for twelve more mutants on the same paths.
> 
> Every test names the single source line it pins in its docstring. Made-up data only; the test clock is explicit and
> nothing here sleeps. The list of the twelve extra mutants is kept next to the build notes, not in this file."""
> 
